I am in the office.
I have my break.
I call the hair salon again.
I need a new appointment.
"Hello, this is Maya Flores," I say.
"I have an appointment on Wednesday at six o'clock."
"I am sorry."
"Unfortunately, I have no time on Wednesday."
The hairdresser is very friendly.
"No problem, Frau Flores," he says.
"Do you have time on Thursday?"
"We have an appointment available at half past seven."
I think about my week.
I always go to the gym on Thursday.
The workout is at half past five.
So half past seven is perfect!
"Yes, Thursday at half past seven is great," I say.
"Wonderful, see you on Thursday!" he says.
I am glad.
Now I have time for the coffee on Wednesday.
